OL,3,GNEWSAMore support for households       
OL,4,Areliant on heating oil                 
OL,6,FHouseholds using heating oil as their  
OL,7,Fmain energy source are being offered   
OL,8,Fmore financial support by North        
OL,9,FNorthamptonshire Council.              
OL,11,FResidents can apply for a #250 voucher 
OL,12,Fin emergency situations where low oil  
OL,13,Flevels would put health, safety or     
OL,14,Fbasic living conditions at risk.       
OL,16,FHeating oil is not protected by the    
OL,17,FOfgem energy price cap, which means    
OL,18,Fthose reliant on it feel price         
OL,19,Fincreases faster than those on mains   
OL,20,Fgas or electricity.                    
